invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the NEON product of two coefficient vectors takes the low halves
  of the 32-bit differences, which are zero, where the quotient by 2^16
  is the high halves. Only an arm64 compiler reads the line, so the
  script builds bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for arm64 and runs it under
  qemu-aarch64. The lane skips without docker, and this then reports
  unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
    return vuzp2q_s16(vreinterpretq_s16_s32(low), vreinterpretq_s16_s32(high));
--- new
    return vuzp1q_s16(vreinterpretq_s16_s32(low), vreinterpretq_s16_s32(high));
